---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_DATA } from '../constants';
import portraitImage from '../assets/portrait.png';

import '../styles/about.css';
---

<Layout pageTitle="About">
    <div class="page-container">
        <h1>About me</h1>

        <div class="about-content">
            <div class="about-intro-wrapper centered-column">
                <div class="about-header centered-column">
                    <Image src={portraitImage} alt={SITE_DATA.name} class="about-portrait" />
                    <h2 class="about-name">{SITE_DATA.name}</h2>
                </div>

                <p class="intro-text">
                    As an insurance professional with more than 17 years of experience across reinsurance and primary insurance
                    I help organizations use data and agentic AI to improve processes, automate work, and turn complex information
                    into actionable insights. I do that by combining deep industry knowledge with hands-on expertise in IT transformation,
                    data, data anlytics and AI.
                <br>
                <br>
                    I started my carreer in reinsurance in 2009 and have managed multiple projects since then.
                    Among others, I headed the PMO of an international IT transformation program focused on transforming the organiozation
                    toward agile ways of working and accelerating IT delivery.
                <br>
                <br>
                    Since 2020, my focus has been on data modeling and analytics (both certified). I have built and delivered multiple
                    data products end-to-end, from data models and automated pipelines to dashboards and reporting capabilities, turning
                    complex, multi-entity insurance data into actionable insights and measurable improvements in business KPIs.
                <br>
                <br>
                    Since 2025, I have been focusing on agentic AI and its application to the insurance industry.
                </p>
            </div>

            <section>
                <h2>My motivation</h2>
                <div class="info-card">
                    <p>
                        “If you are curious and a lifelong learner, there has never been a more exciting time to learn: The age of AI agents.
                        I believe every knowledge worker should develop a basic understanding of the CLI and modern development tools.”
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Specialisations</h2>
                <ul class="custom-list">
                    <li>
                        <span class="list-item-title">Data Modeling</span>
                        <span class="list-item-description">Development of data models from the ground up, starting with the business processees and
                        requirements for the generic data model and transfering them into a logical data model with proper relationships and dependencies.
                        Finally creating the physical data model in a modern stack, for example combining snowflake with dbt.  
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="list-item-title">Data Engineering</span>
                        <span class="list-item-description">Designing and building datapipelines in tools based on Python and SQL.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="list-item-title">Data Analytics</span>
                        <span class="list-item-description">Creating Data Products end-to-end providing insights that enable fast decision making.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="list-item-title">Agentic AI</span>
                        <span class="list-item-description">Using AI Agents for exploratory tasks as well as automation, depending on the use case.
                        I have build a multi-agent application (orchestrator plus three worker agents) entirely via text-based communication using hugging
                        face's smolagents package and Gemini's flash models with the following steps: Inventory check -> Quote generation -> Order fulfilment</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Positions</h2>
                
                            <h3>Currently: Senior Consultant Data and Analytics</h3>
                            <p>Details and positions history is available on <a href={`https://linkedin.com/in/${SITE_DATA.linkedin}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
                    
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>Education</h2>
                <ul class="education-list icon-list">
                    <li>
                        <div class="education-entry">
                            <h3>MBA - Master of Business Administration (E-Business)</h3>
                            <p class="institution">PFH - Private University of Applied Sciences and Arts, Göttingen, 2016</p>
                            <p class="grade">Thesis: "Part-Time Entrepreneurship in E-Commerce: Reducing risks through the use of external services -
                            a case study of a small custom shirt provider</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="education-entry">
                            <h3>MEng - Master of Engineering (Renewable Energies)</h3>
                            <p class="institution">University of Applied Sciences and Arts, Hannover, 2012</p>
                            <p class="grade">Opportunities and risks in China's reinsurance industry amid increasing concentration of insured values</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="education-entry">
                            <h3>BSc in Business Administration (Banking and Insurance)</h3>
                            <p class="institution">University of Applied Sciences and Arts, Hannover, 2009</p>
                            <p class="grade">The impact of the German accounting law "Bilanzrechtsmodernisierungsgesetz"
                            (BilMoG) on the financial reporting of a medium-sized industrial company.</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            
            <section>
                <h2>Contact</h2>
                <p>
                    The best way to get in touch is via <a href={`https://linkedin.com/in/${SITE_DATA.linkedin}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
